## Commands.cpp/view switch
game closed; current ""
shared x -> answers "ran\n"; handed ["x"]; asked nothing; log "shared x\n"; current ""
view switch -> answers "lines go to the view vulpen started with now\n"; handed nothing; asked nothing; log ""; current ""
view switch game -> answers "lines go to game now\n"; handed nothing; asked nothing; log ""; current "game"
view switch game -> answers "lines go to game now\n"; handed nothing; asked nothing; log ""; current "game"
view switch nogame -> throws "no view is named nogame; view list lists those a view hosts"; handed nothing; asked nothing; log ""; current ""

